tal":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested only in 4.7.2.stable for macOS\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.3.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 (Apple7) - Apple M1 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis causes a hard crash on macOS when running the project. I know it seems like a really stupid bug, but I was losing my mind over this, all because I mistakenly added an accelerator to the wrong index. I tried all sorts of fixes, like changing to the compatibility mode, setting the renderer to vulkan instead of metal, but it crashes with zero errors in Godot and only an unreadable crash report in macOS so I had no clue where to look. I figured it out only by checking my git diff one line at a time.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a MenuBar and attach a script (not sure if a PopupMenu can exist without a MenuBar tbh, didn't test that)\n2. Add a PopupMenu as a child to the MenuBar\n3. In the MenuBar's script, add a separator to the PopupMenu\n4. Set an accelerator for the PopupMenu with the index of the separator (dumb mistake)\n5. Run the project\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMinimum reproducible example:\n```\nextends MenuBar\n\n@onready var menu: PopupMenu = $MyPopupMenu\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    menu.add_item(\"Something\")\n    menu.add_separator()  # evil and intimidating separator\n\n    # Where everything goes wrong:\n    view_menu.set_item_accelerator(1, KEY_A)\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124414/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124414/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}